flowchart TD
    S1["1. Client (OpenAI SDK) → AI Gateway<br/>POST /v1/chat/completions"]
    S2["2. Protocol Adapter 识别协议类型<br/>OpenAI Compatible Request"]
    S3["3. Auth Pipeline<br/>API Key 验证 → 租户识别 → 权限校验"]
    S4["4. Rate Limiter<br/>Token Bucket (租户级/用户级/模型级)"]
    S5["5. Intelligent Router<br/>根据模型名 + 路由规则 → 目标模型服务"]
    S6["6. Plugin Chain<br/>审计埋点 → 内容审核 → 请求改写"]
    S7["7. Protocol Transform<br/>OpenAI → 目标模型协议 (如需)"]
    S8["8. Backend Call<br/>Spring AI / LangChain4j → LLM Provider"]
    S9["9. Response Plugin Chain<br/>脱敏 → Token 统计 → 审计"]
    S10["10. Response<br/>Streaming/SSE → Client"]

    S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4 --> S5 --> S6 --> S7 --> S8 --> S9 --> S10

